# Architecture context

## Source of truth

1. Versions: `.cursor/rules/platform-versions.mdc`, `pom.xml`, `ui/package.json`
2. Layout & API: `.cursor/docs/architecture.md`
3. Infra: `.cursor/docs/infrastructure.md`
4. data.gov.in: `.cursor/docs/domain-data-gov-in.md`

## Stack summary

Single Spring Boot JAR + nginx-served static UI on one LXC. API proxies dataset fetches to `api.data.gov.in` (JSON). Explorer: left accordions, right India map (d3).

## Packages

- Java: `org.example.{api,service,service.datagov,client,config,dto,web}`
- Angular: `ui/src/app/{core,features/explorer,services,models}`

When adding endpoints or features, extend existing controllers/services — no new frameworks without need.
